1
00:01:15,859 --> 00:01:18,061
The style of Jiu
Jitsu Do Demands speed

2
00:01:18,101 --> 00:01:19,302
accuracy and power

3
00:02:42,766 --> 00:02:43,807
Master

4
00:02:43,888 --> 00:02:44,969
master

5
00:02:45,090 --> 00:02:46,773
Someone else is
here to challenge you

6
00:02:46,813 --> 00:02:48,535
he's waiting outside

7
00:02:52,984 --> 00:02:53,745
These fools

8
00:02:53,785 --> 00:02:55,387
they'll
never learn

9
00:03:24,681 --> 00:03:26,363
Some tea
for you， sir

10
00:03:26,403 --> 00:03:27,924
Oh，thank you

11
00:03:30,848 --> 00:03:31,569
Your tea，sir

12
00:03:31,609 --> 00:03:48,349
Yo

13
00:03:48,349 --> 00:03:49,710
u're no fighter

14
00:03:53,594 --> 00:03:54,634
Catch

15
00:04:01,036 --> 00:04:02,117
It's your move

16
00:04:02,157 --> 00:04:03,237
Come on

17
00:04:31,230 --> 00:04:32,991
You dare to
challenge me？

18
00:04:52,035 --> 00:04:53,637
嘿，你係好彩我係個好男人
否則你會死，你知唔知？

19
00:04:53,677 --> 00:04:54,918
呢幾日，挑戰係無所不有

20
00:04:54,958 --> 00:04:55,478
Everybody想做第一

21
00:04:55,518 --> 00:04:56,159
但係有啲嘢要煮，係啊

22
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,600
我亦都係被挑戰過

23
00:05:15,536 --> 00:05:16,376
But you beat him

24
00:05:16,416 --> 00:05:17,576
of course

25
00:05:18,216 --> 00:05:19,416
Do you mean…

26
00:05:19,576 --> 00:05:22,176
the challenge
came just out of the blue？

27
00:05:22,376 --> 00:05:23,536
That's right

28
00:05:23,816 --> 00:05:24,376
Last week

29
00:05:24,416 --> 00:05:27,257
I received a letter from this Korean martial arts expert

30
00:05:27,297 --> 00:05:28,977
Challenging
me to a fight

31
00:05:29,017 --> 00:05:32,137
He said people like you and I are not as good as our reputation

32
00:05:32,177 --> 00:05:34,697
Seems like quite
a few people want to see us dead

33
00:05:34,737 --> 00:05:36,097
Said if I didn't
show up for the fight

34
00:05:36,137 --> 00:05:38,497
he'd do something
bad to my family

35
00:05:38,537 --> 00:05:42,097
I was so intrigued by his letter that I decided to show up

36
00:05:42,575 --> 00:05:43,855
Oh，here I am

37
00:05:43,895 --> 00:05:46,215
But I came not
because I'm afraid of your threat

38
00:05:46,255 --> 00:05:49,735
I just want to meet the man who's stupid enough to write a letter like that

39
00:05:50,695 --> 00:05:51,375
Come on then

40
00:05:51,415 --> 00:05:52,975
let's get
it over with

41
00:06:00,334 --> 00:06:01,254
Remember

42
00:06:01,294 --> 00:06:03,614
Kung Fu is the
art of self defence

43
00:06:03,654 --> 00:06:05,334
I'm not
interested in killing

44
00:06:05,374 --> 00:06:08,294
I just want to
prove how bad your kicks are

45
00:06:09,843 --> 00:06:10,883
你唔好再講自己

46
00:06:33,692 --> 00:06:35,613
That's what
we call control

47
00:06:35,653 --> 00:06:38,013
Something you may
never understand

48
00:08:59,167 --> 00:09:00,488
Now my friend

49
00:09:00,528 --> 00:09:01,488
listen

50
00:09:01,649 --> 00:09:04,091
You better hope
that we never meet again

51
00:09:04,131 --> 00:09:06,093
And if you dare
to harm my family

52
00:09:06,133 --> 00:09:06,974
you'll regret it

53
00:09:07,014 --> 00:09:08,534
Because I swear

54
00:09:09,055 --> 00:09:11,217
you'll never be
able to kick again

55
00:09:11,418 --> 00:09:14,420
I don't know if we
'll find out what all these challenges are up to

56
00:09:14,460 --> 00:09:16,742
But I don't think
we need to fear them

57
00:09:17,863 --> 00:09:19,424
How does it
strike you？

58
00:09:20,105 --> 00:09:21,986
Someone may
want us dead

59
00:09:22,447 --> 00:09:23,648
Let them try

60
00:09:23,971 --> 00:09:25,657
I'll think
something will happen

61
00:09:25,697 --> 00:09:27,019
something bad

62
00:10:08,803 --> 00:10:09,443
The stage

63
00:11:18,765 --> 00:11:19,445
打

64
00:12:45,378 --> 00:12:46,418
個訪客？

65
00:12:50,778 --> 00:12:52,738
所以係你

66
00:12:52,898 --> 00:12:54,978
係Billy Loo

67
00:12:59,938 --> 00:13:02,618
Would his
name be praised？

68
00:13:09,991 --> 00:13:10,991
Abbott

69
00:13:14,794 --> 00:13:16,195
It has been
a long time

70
00:13:16,235 --> 00:13:16,755
Forgive me

71
00:13:16,795 --> 00:13:18,396
I trust
you're well

72
00:13:19,397 --> 00:13:21,478
We've much
to discuss

73
00:13:30,044 --> 00:13:31,044
Abbott

74
00:13:33,711 --> 00:13:36,192
The pigeons
sensed your presence

75
00:13:36,473 --> 00:13:40,036
But I'm afraid
their swift departure

76
00:13:40,436 --> 00:13:43,679
Is the sign
of a bad omen

77
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:45,921
You must take care

78
00:13:46,202 --> 00:13:48,163
I shall take
your advice

79
00:13:48,804 --> 00:13:49,484
Billy

80
00:13:49,524 --> 00:13:51,125
remember this

81
00:13:51,526 --> 00:13:54,088
No one is
unbeatable

82
00:13:56,931 --> 00:14:00,694
It's important
that your brother learn from you

83
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:02,901
You're still
making trouble？

84
00:14:03,061 --> 00:14:05,462
Since you've
come to visit us

85
00:14:08,623 --> 00:14:10,544
Why not stay
for a few days？

86
00:14:10,584 --> 00:14:12,305
Your brother
would welcome it

87
00:14:12,345 --> 00:14:13,745
I know
what you mean

88
00:14:14,346 --> 00:14:15,786
Bobby is a rebel

89
00:14:18,547 --> 00:14:21,348
That's why I felt
that I should come and see him

90
00:14:21,669 --> 00:14:24,430
I'm determined to
make sure that he practices hard

91
00:14:24,470 --> 00:14:25,470
What's more

92
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:27,671
I'll see that he
stays clear of trouble

93
00:14:28,716 --> 00:14:29,317
Actually

94
00:14:29,357 --> 00:14:32,118
he doesn't appreciate the fact that what he has here

95
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:35,642
is the chance to
learn Kung Fu from a master such as you

96
00:14:35,682 --> 00:14:36,642
But if…

97
00:14:37,684 --> 00:14:40,966
Bobby persists
in being lazy

98
00:14:41,087 --> 00:14:42,727
he must
be punished

99
00:14:43,369 --> 00:14:44,570
Be patient with him

100
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:46,931
he's still
young and in a hurry

101
00:14:47,692 --> 00:14:49,373
But I know
him too well

102
00:14:49,454 --> 00:14:51,975
So little training and he thinks he's good

103
00:14:52,416 --> 00:14:54,337
But to
become an expert

104
00:14:55,056 --> 00:14:57,577
He has to study
and practise harder

105
00:14:57,698 --> 00:15:00,339
I'm sure he'll
take your advice

106
00:15:00,739 --> 00:15:02,020
You know he's
my only brother

107
00:15:02,060 --> 00:15:04,901
and it's my father
's wish and mine that he'll succeed

108
00:15:04,941 --> 00:15:07,902
And pass on to
others the benefits of Kung Fu

109
00:15:10,344 --> 00:15:12,225
I understand，Ed

110
00:15:12,465 --> 00:15:15,747
I know too how
much you care about him

111
00:15:16,267 --> 00:15:17,708
His future

112
00:15:18,618 --> 00:15:19,498
But

113
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:21,421
when you
talk to him

114
00:15:21,461 --> 00:15:23,583
don't be too
mean to him

115
00:15:25,146 --> 00:15:26,707
Be sincere with him

116
00:15:26,747 --> 00:15:28,309
make sure he
understands

117
00:15:28,349 --> 00:15:30,311
And，remember

118
00:15:30,872 --> 00:15:32,033
When you
were a child

119
00:15:32,073 --> 00:15:33,435
you were also
a troublemaker

120
00:15:33,475 --> 00:15:35,677
Up to all
kinds of mischief

121
00:15:36,503 --> 00:15:38,184
You refused
to study hard

122
00:15:38,224 --> 00:15:41,544
instead fooled
around on the streets stealing things

123
00:15:41,785 --> 00:15:43,345
Yes，I
remember that

124
00:15:43,385 --> 00:15:44,506
I had no
discipline

125
00:15:44,546 --> 00:15:45,426
no principles

126
00:15:45,466 --> 00:15:47,187
and no
respect for anybody

127
00:15:47,227 --> 00:15:49,787
You weren't even
afraid of the police

128
00:15:51,828 --> 00:15:55,389
You also had that
innocent look that'll fool any adult

129
00:15:55,429 --> 00:15:58,430
Not knowing what
your evil little mind was up to

130
00:16:01,067 --> 00:16:02,268
Hey，you
little thief

131
00:16:02,308 --> 00:16:03,990
you stealing my things

132
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:06,232
You were
also a bully

133
00:16:06,994 --> 00:16:07,955
I sure was

134
00:16:07,995 --> 00:16:09,276
Why'd you
do that for？

135
00:16:09,316 --> 00:16:10,317
Because I don
't like you

136
00:16:10,357 --> 00:16:11,638
And I hate you too

137
00:16:19,047 --> 00:16:22,767
Yeah， I'll go
tell your parents

138
00:16:22,807 --> 00:16:24,127
I'll take him
to go beating

139
00:16:24,167 --> 00:16:24,767
Fortunately

140
00:16:24,807 --> 00:16:26,247
he didn't
know any gung fu

141
00:16:26,287 --> 00:16:28,528
You even
attacked old blind men

142
00:16:28,568 --> 00:16:29,608
As a
martial artist

143
00:16:29,648 --> 00:16:31,008
I'd never do that

144
00:16:31,048 --> 00:16:33,128
I'd forgotten I
was such a terror

145
00:16:35,328 --> 00:16:36,089
My goodness

146
00:16:36,129 --> 00:16:37,009
so small

147
00:16:37,049 --> 00:16:39,049
and you dare to
attack an old man？

148
00:16:39,089 --> 00:16:40,169
Who cares if
you're old？

149
00:16:40,209 --> 00:16:41,409
Only the
strong survive

150
00:16:41,449 --> 00:16:43,929
Oh，oh，oh，oh，oh

151
00:16:44,650 --> 00:16:45,610
oh，oh，oh

152
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:53,291
我唔會料

153
00:16:54,412 --> 00:16:56,052
Help， help

154
00:16:58,373 --> 00:16:59,613
It was only later

155
00:16:59,653 --> 00:17:02,694
after you had
grown up and moved in with your sister

156
00:17:02,734 --> 00:17:05,134
That you started
to respond to her advice

157
00:17:05,174 --> 00:17:08,495
and constant pleas to discipline yourself and behave

158
00:17:10,128 --> 00:17:12,290
Here，mother wouldn
't take my money

159
00:17:13,372 --> 00:17:14,814
Of course
she wouldn't

160
00:17:14,854 --> 00:17:16,856
You got it by
cheating the cards

161
00:17:16,977 --> 00:17:18,859
At least I
didn't steal it

162
00:17:21,823 --> 00:17:23,025
I know
how you feel

163
00:17:23,065 --> 00:17:24,586
You're
ashamed of me

164
00:17:24,988 --> 00:17:27,029
I'm the black
sheep of the family

165
00:17:27,311 --> 00:17:29,112
Everybody
despises me

166
00:17:29,714 --> 00:17:30,635
I don't care
what they say

167
00:17:30,675 --> 00:17:31,595
Billy

168
00:17:32,095 --> 00:17:34,735
All mother and I
care about is what you're doing to yourself

169
00:17:35,134 --> 00:17:35,894
Don't worry

170
00:17:35,934 --> 00:17:38,134
I know what I've
got to do from now on

171
00:17:39,014 --> 00:17:39,934
Mother

172
00:17:41,254 --> 00:17:42,574
I've been wrong

173
00:17:43,534 --> 00:17:45,094
But I
understand now

174
00:17:45,774 --> 00:17:46,934
I'll make sure
you're proud of me

175
00:17:46,974 --> 00:17:50,173
Now it's your
brother's turn

176
00:17:52,933 --> 00:17:54,573
He's still young
immature

177
00:17:54,613 --> 00:17:56,453
full of
his own ideas

178
00:17:57,445 --> 00:18:00,685
I'm sure that he'
ll soon change his outlook

179
00:18:01,005 --> 00:18:02,805
once you've had
a talk with him

180
00:18:03,885 --> 00:18:05,925
I just hope
that you're right

181
00:18:06,605 --> 00:18:08,125
You've
never failed

182
00:18:08,405 --> 00:18:09,845
go meet
your brother

183
00:18:10,965 --> 00:18:11,845
Right

184
00:19:16,822 --> 00:19:17,703
Dear Bobby

185
00:19:17,743 --> 00:19:18,863
how are you？

186
00:19:22,746 --> 00:19:24,268
I was
hoping to see you

187
00:19:24,308 --> 00:19:25,589
but you were out

188
00:19:25,629 --> 00:19:27,229
Sorry，I missed you

189
00:19:28,831 --> 00:19:32,634
I gather you're
not studying or training so hard lately

190
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:35,380
I guess I don't
have to tell you

191
00:19:35,861 --> 00:19:39,062
That to become an
expert in the art of kung fu

192
00:19:39,542 --> 00:19:41,462
You must
practise more

193
00:19:42,303 --> 00:19:44,543
There'll be time
for girls later

194
00:19:45,744 --> 00:19:48,385
Learn all that
the abbot teaches you

195
00:19:52,987 --> 00:19:55,507
I'm leaving you
my boxing manual

196
00:19:56,268 --> 00:19:58,708
In the hope that
you'll find it useful

197
00:19:58,789 --> 00:20:00,469
Try to concentrate

198
00:20:01,004 --> 00:20:03,205
Don't let your
father and me down

199
00:20:04,566 --> 00:20:06,127
Take care
of yourself

200
00:20:06,167 --> 00:20:07,247
Bye now

201
00:20:07,327 --> 00:20:08,168
Your brother Billy

202
00:20:43,574 --> 00:20:45,054
Died so sudden？

203
00:20:47,894 --> 00:20:50,055
You haven't
slept all night？

204
00:20:51,735 --> 00:20:52,975
Yes，I know

205
00:20:54,896 --> 00:20:56,336
Sit down，Dad

206
00:20:58,897 --> 00:21:00,857
Too bad
about Jin Koo

207
00:21:00,977 --> 00:21:03,858
Kung Fu expert
die so young？

208
00:21:04,018 --> 00:21:05,138
That's right

209
00:21:05,298 --> 00:21:06,338
Tell me

210
00:21:06,458 --> 00:21:07,659
do you think

211
00:21:07,699 --> 00:21:09,659
that he
overtrained？

212
00:21:10,816 --> 00:21:12,659
Uh huh

213
00:21:12,699 --> 00:21:15,062
There's nothing
you can do now

214
00:21:15,424 --> 00:21:16,465
Don't
think too much

215
00:21:16,505 --> 00:21:18,347
try to get
some sleep

216
00:21:18,909 --> 00:21:20,031
Don't worry，Father

217
00:21:20,071 --> 00:21:21,873
I won't let
it bother me

218
00:21:22,315 --> 00:21:25,158
I'll attend his
funeral a couple of days from now

219
00:21:26,233 --> 00:21:28,833
Then I'd like you
to represent me too

220
00:21:28,873 --> 00:21:30,273
You're not going？

221
00:21:30,633 --> 00:21:31,393
No

222
00:21:31,953 --> 00:21:33,913
I'm far too
old to travel

223
00:21:33,953 --> 00:21:34,913
my son

224
00:21:34,953 --> 00:21:36,433
It isn't wise

225
00:21:36,473 --> 00:21:38,633
Think Bobby ought
to come along with me？

226
00:21:39,633 --> 00:21:41,753
No，I'd rather
he didn't go

227
00:21:42,153 --> 00:21:44,313
He shouldn't
be told of this

228
00:21:45,433 --> 00:21:46,073
But why not

229
00:21:46,113 --> 00:21:46,953
father？

230
00:21:46,993 --> 00:21:48,313
It's better…

231
00:21:48,953 --> 00:21:51,633
that we shouldn'
t disturb the lad

232
00:21:52,818 --> 00:21:53,658
Okay， in that case

233
00:21:53,698 --> 00:21:54,418
I'll go alone

234
00:21:54,458 --> 00:21:56,498
Her first
thing to do

235
00:21:56,698 --> 00:21:58,897
is to look
for his daughter

236
00:22:01,457 --> 00:22:02,897
He has a daughter？

237
00:22:03,376 --> 00:22:04,457
The truth is

238
00:22:04,497 --> 00:22:06,619
she's his
stepdaughter

239
00:22:06,659 --> 00:22:07,419
That's a surprise

240
00:22:07,459 --> 00:22:08,901
he sure
kept that quiet

241
00:22:08,941 --> 00:22:11,023
Only his
friends knew the truth

242
00:22:11,063 --> 00:22:12,224
Do you know
where she lives now？

243
00:22:12,264 --> 00:22:13,545
And what's
her name？

244
00:22:13,585 --> 00:22:14,906
Name's May

245
00:22:15,066 --> 00:22:17,188
I believe
she sings

246
00:22:17,469 --> 00:22:19,590
At a club
in the Ginza

247
00:22:20,151 --> 00:22:22,873
You'll have to
make some inquiries

248
00:23:42,176 --> 00:23:44,696
奇行屋屋敷出身嘅女

249
00:23:44,777 --> 00:23:47,418
そんな名前に飽きて
あの人の向こうの人の，みんなを分かれて

250
00:23:47,458 --> 00:23:48,338
わざわからしの部屋

251
00:25:42,645 --> 00:25:43,886
What do you want？

252
00:25:44,207 --> 00:25:45,328
Who are you？

253
00:25:47,492 --> 00:25:49,253
I'd like to
talk to you

254
00:25:49,855 --> 00:25:50,897
Talk to me？

255
00:25:50,937 --> 00:25:52,378
I don't
even know you

256
00:25:58,788 --> 00:26:00,469
Don't let
that bother you

257
00:26:01,049 --> 00:26:02,569
Because I know you

258
00:26:02,650 --> 00:26:04,090
You must be crazy

259
00:26:04,330 --> 00:26:05,370
You're
talking rubbish

260
00:26:05,410 --> 00:26:06,610
No，I'm not

261
00:26:06,650 --> 00:26:08,971
I'm Li Chen Chang

262
00:26:09,651 --> 00:26:10,571
I knew your father

263
00:26:10,611 --> 00:26:12,132
we were
good friends

264
00:26:14,172 --> 00:26:15,972
Your father just died

265
00:26:16,373 --> 00:26:19,733
Aren't you ashamed of singing and enjoying yourself in here？

266
00:26:19,773 --> 00:26:21,854
Don't you feel
any remorse at all？

267
00:26:22,894 --> 00:26:23,974
I don't

268
00:26:26,935 --> 00:26:28,335
So he's dead

269
00:26:31,093 --> 00:26:32,294
So what？

270
00:26:37,781 --> 00:26:39,624
Being sad won't
bring him back

271
00:26:39,664 --> 00:26:42,747
I get the impression that you have no respect for him

272
00:26:43,388 --> 00:26:45,030
He never
cared for me

273
00:26:45,671 --> 00:26:47,473
So I sing to
make a living

274
00:26:47,513 --> 00:26:48,834
Nevertheless

275
00:26:50,237 --> 00:26:51,358
You ought to
respect him

276
00:26:51,398 --> 00:26:52,880
he was your father

277
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:54,401
Some father？

278
00:26:54,442 --> 00:26:56,324
Where was he
when mother died？

279
00:26:59,599 --> 00:27:00,960
Forget the past

280
00:27:01,521 --> 00:27:02,722
You bet I will

281
00:27:02,762 --> 00:27:04,443
Nothing I can
do about it now

282
00:27:04,483 --> 00:27:06,324
Just pretend it
never happened

283
00:27:06,605 --> 00:27:08,887
I can't figure
out how he died so suddenly

284
00:27:08,927 --> 00:27:10,248
Chinku was
a strong man

285
00:27:10,288 --> 00:27:11,209
so full of life

286
00:27:11,249 --> 00:27:11,889
it's strange

287
00:27:11,929 --> 00:27:13,931
I don't know much
about him at all

288
00:27:14,354 --> 00:27:16,837
We haven't been
in contact for a long time

289
00:27:16,877 --> 00:27:18,398
But then he came
to see me last month

290
00:27:18,438 --> 00:27:19,799
If you lost
contact for so long

291
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:21,601
why did he
suddenly come to see you？

292
00:27:21,641 --> 00:27:22,402
I don't know

293
00:27:22,442 --> 00:27:24,003
but he left
a box with me

294
00:27:24,043 --> 00:27:25,645
He said to
keep it safe

295
00:27:25,685 --> 00:27:26,725
What is it？

296
00:27:26,846 --> 00:27:28,126
I'm not sure

297
00:27:28,287 --> 00:27:28,968
A roll of film

298
00:27:29,008 --> 00:27:30,008
I think

299
00:27:38,176 --> 00:27:38,817
Where is the film？

300
00:27:38,857 --> 00:27:40,218
Can you
show it to me？

301
00:27:50,344 --> 00:27:51,224
Here

302
00:27:54,026 --> 00:27:55,466
Inside this box

303
00:29:19,694 --> 00:29:22,136
喂，你喺度啊，喂，你…

304
00:29:22,176 --> 00:29:22,856
你…

305
00:33:02,886 --> 00:33:04,808
我哋入去喇，你哋喺度等我

306
00:33:04,848 --> 00:33:05,969
唔會畀你哋等太耐，好嘢

307
00:33:43,347 --> 00:33:44,587
What do you want？

308
00:33:45,107 --> 00:33:46,667
No one's
allowed in here

309
00:33:48,507 --> 00:33:50,347
I'm a good
friend of Chinko

310
00:33:51,748 --> 00:33:53,828
Just want to pay
my last respects to him

311
00:33:53,868 --> 00:33:54,908
That's all

312
00:33:55,388 --> 00:33:57,268
I told you no
one comes in

313
00:33:57,748 --> 00:33:58,228
If you're wise

314
00:33:58,268 --> 00:33:59,668
you'll
leave right now

315
00:34:00,428 --> 00:34:01,588
Now get out

316
00:34:49,718 --> 00:34:52,202
Hey， Sherman

317
00:36:17,086 --> 00:36:19,045
喂，唔好啊，唔好

318
00:38:31,904 --> 00:38:33,225
Bobby，my son

319
00:38:33,265 --> 00:38:34,907
sadly I
must tell you

320
00:38:34,947 --> 00:38:37,628
That your
brother Billy is dead

321
00:38:37,709 --> 00:38:39,870
He was trying to
find out why hi

322
00:38:39,870 --> 00:38:42,152
s friends
and crew died

323
00:38:42,192 --> 00:38:45,794
He devoted his
life to the art of Kung Fu

324
00:38:46,075 --> 00:38:48,477
His own style
of Jiu Quado

325
00:38:48,517 --> 00:38:51,159
Recorded for the
benefit of everyone

326
00:38:51,199 --> 00:38:53,721
In his own
boxing manual

327
00:38:53,841 --> 00:38:54,521
My son

328
00:38:54,561 --> 00:38:56,362
after you've
read this letter

329
00:38:56,402 --> 00:38:59,644
Go to Japan and
meet up with Sherman Lang

330
00:38:59,684 --> 00:39:01,605
Find out who
killed your brother

331
00:39:01,645 --> 00:39:02,725
Seek revenge

332
00:39:02,765 --> 00:39:06,286
only then will
his soul rest in peace

333
00:40:18,092 --> 00:40:18,933
Hey， Bobby

334
00:40:18,973 --> 00:40:20,654
Hi， Sherman

335
00:40:21,376 --> 00:40:22,457
I'm sorry
I'm a bit late

336
00:40:22,497 --> 00:40:23,298
Just
arrived myself

337
00:40:23,338 --> 00:40:24,339
Let's go

338
00:40:48,939 --> 00:40:50,221
This is all that
your brother left

339
00:40:50,261 --> 00:40:50,982
It's roll of film

340
00:40:51,022 --> 00:40:52,503
I think you
better have it

341
00:40:56,950 --> 00:40:59,793
This dart is the
weapon they used to kill your brother

342
00:41:05,660 --> 00:41:08,462
Have you any idea
why they wanted to steal Chingu's cup？

343
00:41:08,502 --> 00:41:09,183
Have no idea

344
00:41:09,223 --> 00:41:10,624
it's a
mystery to me

345
00:41:11,305 --> 00:41:13,147
Well，it's all
very strange

346
00:41:13,187 --> 00:41:13,988
I don't understand

347
00:41:14,028 --> 00:41:15,708
there must
have been a reason

348
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,600
But what？

349
00:41:17,681 --> 00:41:18,241
Anyway

350
00:41:18,281 --> 00:41:19,482
I'll take you
to our master

351
00:41:19,522 --> 00:41:20,882
he's waiting for you

352
00:41:22,003 --> 00:41:23,964
Sherman，I'm
gonna get my revenge

353
00:41:24,004 --> 00:41:24,725
Of course

354
00:41:24,765 --> 00:41:25,886
we'll help
you all we can

355
00:41:25,926 --> 00:41:28,207
But you need to
think it through carefully

356
00:41:40,855 --> 00:41:42,255
What's this place？

357
00:41:42,866 --> 00:41:44,666
The Palace of Death

358
00:41:48,665 --> 00:41:50,225
Who's that
foreigner？

359
00:41:50,464 --> 00:41:51,344
That's Louis

360
00:41:51,384 --> 00:41:53,184
master of
the palace

361
00:41:54,704 --> 00:41:56,183
Who's that guy？

362
00:41:56,503 --> 00:41:57,583
That's Louis's val

363
00:41:57,703 --> 00:42:02,942
et

364
00:42:02,982 --> 00:42:03,702
Oh？

365
00:42:03,742 --> 00:42:05,302
Chenko，what's
he doing there？

366
00:42:05,342 --> 00:42:06,182
Well

367
00:42:07,021 --> 00:42:08,781
he was
Louis's guest

368
00:42:09,894 --> 00:42:12,214
Huh，they look
like great friends

369
00:42:16,615 --> 00:42:18,175
The valley's
lost an arm

370
00:42:18,215 --> 00:42:20,135
He doesn't act
handicapped though

371
00:42:20,175 --> 00:42:22,135
He's very
loyal to Louis

372
00:42:22,335 --> 00:42:24,616
Never leaves his
side for a minute

373
00:42:26,856 --> 00:42:29,376
What's Chingko
doing teaching Louis Kung Fu？

374
00:42:29,417 --> 00:42:32,257
Seems that Louis
is interested in Kung Fu

375
00:42:33,017 --> 00:42:34,337
For the
purpose of killing

376
00:42:34,377 --> 00:42:35,618
seems to enjoy it

377
00:42:35,658 --> 00:42:37,138
The man's mad

378
00:42:51,265 --> 00:42:52,585
It's strange

379
00:42:52,746 --> 00:42:54,866
that palace of death

380
00:42:55,347 --> 00:42:57,548
I think I'll go
and check it out

381
00:42:57,628 --> 00:42:59,029
Forget Louis

382
00:42:59,069 --> 00:43:01,630
his kung fu's
not that hot

383
00:43:01,710 --> 00:43:03,791
But that palace
is a death trap

384
00:43:03,831 --> 00:43:06,272
No one ever
leaves that place alive

385
00:43:06,992 --> 00:43:07,873
So please

386
00:43:07,913 --> 00:43:09,433
be very careful

387
00:43:58,986 --> 00:43:59,267
Master

388
00:43:59,307 --> 00:44:00,949
there's a Bobby
Low to see you

389
00:44:00,989 --> 00:44:02,150
Bobby Low？

390
00:44:02,631 --> 00:44:04,754
Could he be
Billy Low's brother？

391
00:44:05,355 --> 00:44:07,878
I wonder what
that little punk wants with me

392
00:44:08,760 --> 00:44:10,562
Tell a valet
to show him in

393
00:44:10,602 --> 00:44:11,483
Right

394
00:44:16,210 --> 00:44:18,292
Maybe it's
about Billy's death

395
00:45:11,731 --> 00:45:13,531
So you're Mr
Bobby Low

396
00:45:13,571 --> 00:45:15,212
You're
most welcome

397
00:45:15,292 --> 00:45:18,813
I suppose that you
're Billy Low's younger brother

398
00:45:18,853 --> 00:45:20,093
That's right

399
00:45:20,133 --> 00:45:23,295
I hear the Palace
of Death really lives up to its name

400
00:45:23,335 --> 00:45:25,135
They say no one
leaves here alive

401
00:45:25,175 --> 00:45:27,616
Like I've walked
into the Valley of Death

402
00:45:27,696 --> 00:45:28,376
Not true

403
00:45:28,416 --> 00:45:29,817
they're just
vicious rumours

404
00:45:29,857 --> 00:45:31,737
You know what
people are like

405
00:45:31,777 --> 00:45:34,858
People tell me you
're very good friend of Ching Goo

406
00:45:36,275 --> 00:45:38,515
Yeah，his kung
fu's excellent

407
00:45:39,076 --> 00:45:40,596
I respect him

408
00:45:40,836 --> 00:45:43,477
Perhaps even
jealous of him

409
00:45:46,918 --> 00:45:49,279
So what are you
trying to suggest？

410
00:45:49,959 --> 00:45:51,920
Chinko did spend
some time here before

411
00:45:51,960 --> 00:45:54,360
but I had nothing
to do with his death

412
00:45:54,560 --> 00:45:56,241
Is that right？

413
00:45:56,778 --> 00:45:58,419
Anyway，that's over

414
00:45:58,459 --> 00:45:59,939
let's forget it

415
00:46:00,299 --> 00:46:02,700
Since you had the
guts to come here

416
00:46:02,741 --> 00:46:05,062
Let me take you
and show you around

417
00:46:05,102 --> 00:46:07,223
I think you'll
find it interesting

418
00:46:07,263 --> 00:46:09,423
I'm sure it'll
be an experience

419
00:46:09,463 --> 00:46:11,344
The pleasure
's all mine

420
00:46:15,266 --> 00:46:17,467
I'm impressed
with your manner

421
00:46:17,627 --> 00:46:19,948
Now let's see if
you have courage

422
00:46:20,068 --> 00:46:20,508
Come on

423
00:46:20,548 --> 00:46:22,909
I'm sure you'll
find it fascinating

424
00:46:31,546 --> 00:46:33,268
Now look
over there

425
00:46:35,313 --> 00:46:37,436
I keep a lot of
specially trained peacocks

426
00:46:37,476 --> 00:46:40,040
They obey my
every command

427
00:46:40,642 --> 00:46:42,925
Peacocks
obeying your command？

428
00:46:53,474 --> 00:46:55,394
That's
quite remarkable

429
00:46:56,314 --> 00:46:57,875
Exactly

430
00:46:58,515 --> 00:47:00,795
It takes a
lot of training

431
00:47:07,837 --> 00:47:09,118
It's quite
fantastic

432
00:47:09,158 --> 00:47:10,198
isn't it？

433
00:47:11,078 --> 00:47:12,598
Look at that，here

434
00:47:41,421 --> 00:47:42,861
They're
really big lions

435
00:47:42,901 --> 00:47:44,381
kinda frightening

436
00:47:44,421 --> 00:47:45,421
There's so
many of th

437
00:47:45,421 --> 00:47:49,980
em

438
00:47:50,020 --> 00:47:52,420
I had 'em all
imported from Africa

439
00:48:25,145 --> 00:48:28,104
I selected the
biggest and best of their breed

440
00:48:28,144 --> 00:48:30,103
They have
enormous appetites

441
00:48:30,143 --> 00:48:32,143
And their
favourite food is…

442
00:48:32,622 --> 00:48:34,981
fresh juicy
raw human meat

443
00:48:35,021 --> 00:48:36,101
They always eat a lot

444
00:48:36,141 --> 00:48:37,621
bones and all

445
00:48:48,914 --> 00:48:51,515
Anyone who comes
to challenge me and then loses

446
00:48:51,555 --> 00:48:53,756
ends up as
dinner for the lions

447
00:48:55,038 --> 00:48:58,599
My challengers
all try to act very tough

448
00:48:58,920 --> 00:49:00,081
But not for long

449
00:49:00,121 --> 00:49:02,002
I'm not surprised they're scared

450
00:49:02,042 --> 00:49:05,484
Certainly hope I
won't end up as their dinner tonight

451
00:49:08,671 --> 00:49:09,392
Don't worry

452
00:49:09,432 --> 00:49:10,914
friend，you won't

453
00:49:11,475 --> 00:49:12,957
What are we
waiting for then？

454
00:49:12,997 --> 00:49:14,239
Come on，let's go

455
00:49:14,279 --> 00:49:15,000
Come on

456
00:49:15,040 --> 00:49:16,001
Okay

457
00:49:20,208 --> 00:49:22,371
The lion is truly
king of all beasts

458
00:49:22,411 --> 00:49:23,012
Undeniably

459
00:49:23,052 --> 00:49:25,575
the fastest and
the most powerful animal

460
00:49:26,102 --> 00:49:29,145
A good kung fu fighter should have the speed and power of a lion

461
00:49:29,185 --> 00:49:32,108
Especially when
fighting his enemies

462
00:49:32,148 --> 00:49:34,070
He should be
ruthless like the lion

463
00:49:34,110 --> 00:49:35,271
A killer

464
00:49:36,313 --> 00:49:38,434
And why do you
keep the peacocks？

465
00:49:38,675 --> 00:49:39,796
I like the
way they move

466
00:49:39,836 --> 00:49:41,678
so swift
and so sure

467
00:49:41,718 --> 00:49:43,761
Kung fu fighters
should be fierce like a lion

468
00:49:43,801 --> 00:49:45,122
and swift
like a peacock

469
00:49:45,162 --> 00:49:47,364
So I study
their styles

470
00:49:47,805 --> 00:49:49,726
An interesting theory

471
00:49:55,042 --> 00:49:55,803
Excuse me sir

472
00:49:55,843 --> 00:49:59,004
Two men calling themselves the Yen brothers say they want to challenge you

473
00:49:59,044 --> 00:50:00,964
Those two
stupid fools

474
00:50:01,325 --> 00:50:02,966
They're no
match for me

475
00:50:03,006 --> 00:50:04,126
Alright， son

476
00:50:04,166 --> 00:50:05,487
Take them to
the cemetery first

477
00:50:05,527 --> 00:50:06,607
Let them
look around

478
00:50:06,647 --> 00:50:08,648
Maybe then they'
ll change their minds

479
00:50:08,688 --> 00:50:09,488
Sir

480
00:50:32,873 --> 00:50:33,553
哼

481
00:50:36,916 --> 00:50:37,796
See？

482
00:50:38,077 --> 00:50:40,799
These are the
gravestones of my master's challenges

483
00:50:43,940 --> 00:50:46,259
I'm afraid you'll
be joining them very soon

484
00:50:50,739 --> 00:50:51,978
I'd leave now
if I were you

485
00:50:52,018 --> 00:50:54,498
Unless you
want to die young

486
00:50:59,177 --> 00:51:00,977
You can't make us
change our minds

487
00:51:01,017 --> 00:51:02,457
We're not
afraid of him

488
00:51:02,497 --> 00:51:04,017
Call him out here

489
00:51:56,727 --> 00:51:59,529
打擊你啊，驚你啊

490
00:51:59,569 --> 00:52:01,290
打擊你啊，打

491
00:53:22,764 --> 00:53:24,685
哎吔，好嘢

492
00:54:34,696 --> 00:54:35,376
係

493
00:55:00,221 --> 00:55:01,701
It's rather late

494
00:55:01,942 --> 00:55:03,302
What are
you doing？

495
00:55:03,782 --> 00:55:05,783
Somebody
just attacked me

496
00:55:06,383 --> 00:55:08,104
Someone
attacked you？

497
00:55:08,144 --> 00:55:09,024
No way

498
00:55:09,064 --> 00:55:10,705
no one
would dare to

499
00:55:12,065 --> 00:55:14,026
I just
fought him off

500
00:55:14,266 --> 00:55:15,667
Take it easy

501
00:55:15,707 --> 00:55:17,307
we'll
talk tomorrow

502
00:56:08,989 --> 00:56:10,029
Morning

503
00:56:10,431 --> 00:56:12,753
so you're an
early riser too

504
00:56:14,276 --> 00:56:15,436
Have a seat

505
00:56:22,126 --> 00:56:24,448
Hope I'm not
interrupting your breakfast

506
00:56:24,729 --> 00:56:25,530
Of course not

507
00:56:25,570 --> 00:56:27,051
why not join me？

508
00:56:28,254 --> 00:56:29,135
Great meal

509
00:56:29,175 --> 00:56:30,856
this is
raw venison

510
00:56:33,227 --> 00:56:34,667
Deer's blood

511
00:56:42,308 --> 00:56:43,428
Why not have
some with me？

512
00:56:43,468 --> 00:56:45,348
Oh，oh，thanks

513
00:56:45,388 --> 00:56:48,029
Not my idea of
a nice breakfast

514
00:56:49,829 --> 00:56:51,189
About last night

515
00:56:51,229 --> 00:56:53,229
You serious
about that attack？

516
00:56:54,133 --> 00:56:55,413
Don't worry

517
00:56:55,693 --> 00:56:57,372
It was
all my fault

518
00:56:57,412 --> 00:57:00,092
I really shouldn'
t have been out late anyway

519
00:57:00,172 --> 00:57:02,012
There's
nothing to stop you

520
00:57:02,372 --> 00:57:03,972
You are my guest

521
00:57:04,372 --> 00:57:05,331
Louis

522
00:57:05,571 --> 00:57:07,531
I know you
mean me no harm

523
00:57:07,611 --> 00:57:11,291
But I'm certain
that someone here is plotting to kill you

524
00:57:12,850 --> 00:57:13,890
Really？

525
00:57:21,013 --> 00:57:22,893
Who would
dare to do that？

526
00:57:24,093 --> 00:57:25,253
What about
your staff？

527
00:57:25,293 --> 00:57:27,013
You suspect
any of them？

528
00:57:32,013 --> 00:57:32,373
Tell me

529
00:57:32,413 --> 00:57:34,092
when did you
employ your valet？

530
00:57:34,132 --> 00:57:36,052
Has he always
been handicapped？

531
00:57:36,132 --> 00:57:37,652
Why ask about him？

532
00:57:38,292 --> 00:57:40,452
There's something
strange about him

533
00:57:40,612 --> 00:57:41,292
The fact is

534
00:57:41,332 --> 00:57:42,692
I suspect him

535
00:57:45,606 --> 00:57:47,647
He's been
with me for years

536
00:57:47,887 --> 00:57:49,328
Used to be a monk

537
00:57:49,648 --> 00:57:50,729
A monk？

538
00:57:53,130 --> 00:57:55,291
Yeah，from the
Fan Yue Temple

539
00:57:55,572 --> 00:57:57,212
I'm sorry for him

540
00:57:57,293 --> 00:57:58,613
I hired him

541
00:57:58,653 --> 00:58:00,574
Where's the
Fan Yue Temple？

542
00:58:00,614 --> 00:58:02,095
Quite near here

543
00:58:02,375 --> 00:58:05,176
There's rumour to
be a tower of death

544
00:58:05,337 --> 00:58:06,417
But then

545
00:58:06,978 --> 00:58:09,379
no one has ever
seen this tower

546
00:58:09,419 --> 00:58:10,459
Why's that？

547
00:58:12,653 --> 00:58:12,933
Well

548
00:58:12,973 --> 00:58:15,296
people say
hundreds of years ago

549
00:58:15,336 --> 00:58:18,419
An abbot called
Hung Kuang built the tower

550
00:58:18,621 --> 00:58:20,102
under the ground

551
00:58:26,831 --> 00:58:27,753
Excuse me，Mister

552
00:58:27,793 --> 00:58:29,114
please leave
us for a moment

553
00:58:29,154 --> 00:58:31,437
I have something
to discuss with Master

554
00:59:23,720 --> 00:59:24,480
Hey

555
00:59:25,440 --> 00:59:28,361
how are

556
